From 59d8531d97c80106a262468a9e16670a8db7a404 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Uwe L. Korn" <uwe.korn@quantco.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:21:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Fix compatibility with newer protobuf and abseil libraries
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Update ABSL_LIBS to reflect renamed/added/removed abseil library components
and fix mysqlxpb.cc to handle protobuf API changes:
- field name methods now return std::string_view instead of std::string
- FieldDescriptor::label() has been removed, use is_repeated()/is_required() instead

abseil 20260817 merged the CRC CPU detection component into
absl_base_cpu_detect, so the now-missing absl_crc_cpu_detect must no longer
be linked unconditionally.

🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
